---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Certifications | Julian Parco</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen">
    
    {/* Navigation */}
    <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <a href="/my-portfolio/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 font-medium flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors">
        &larr; Back to Home
      </a>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
      
      <header class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Licenses & Certifications</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl">
          Verified credentials demonstrating my proficiency in cybersecurity protocols, network infrastructure, and foundational IT operations.
        </p>
      </header>

      {/* Certifications Grid */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        {/* Google Cybersecurity Certificate */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-500 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-white">
              <span class="text-blue-500">G</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">Google Cybersecurity Professional</h2>
              <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-medium">Issued by Google</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Comprehensive certification covering threat landscape analysis, Python automation, Linux and SQL, packet analysis, and security information and event management (SIEM) tools.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Completed</span>
            <a href="#" class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1">
              Verify Credential <span class="text-lg">&nearr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Cisco Certification */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-500 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-white">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">C</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">Cisco Networking Academy</h2>
              <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-medium">Issued by Cisco</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Validation of skills in routing, switching, network applications, protocols, and services. Emphasizes foundational knowledge required to design and implement secure networks.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Completed</span>
            <a href="#" class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1">
              Verify Credential <span class="text-lg">&nearr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Placeholder for Future Cert (e.g., ITDC completion or future cert) */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700 border-dashed p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-2xl">+</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-400 mb-2">Continuous Learning</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-xs">
            Currently pursuing further certifications to expand my expertise in backend architecture and cloud infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>